816
00:35:48,000 --> 00:35:49,000
It's a democratic...

817
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:51,000
You're smiling, Alex, already.

818
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:53,000
You're confident you can reply to all of these?

819
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:58,000
So, taxation by consent of the governed

820
00:35:58,000 --> 00:35:59,000
is not coerced.

821
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:02,000
Third, some people have said,

822
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:05,000
don't the successful, like Gates,

823
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:08,000
owe a debt to society for their success

824
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:10,000
that they repay by paying taxes?

825
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:12,000
Who wants to respond to the first one?

826
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:14,000
The poor need the money more.

827
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:15,000
All right.

828
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,000
And you're?

829
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:17,000
John.

830
