John. All right, John.

831
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:19,000
Let's see. Here, I'll hold it.

832
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,000
All right.

833
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:21,000
The poor need the money more.

834
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:22,000
